// Copy the "xyPlot.ignoreFolders" key below into .vscode/settings.json (this
// workspace only) or your User settings.json (every workspace) — Command
// Palette -> "Preferences: Open Workspace Settings (JSON)" / "...User
// Settings (JSON)".
//
// Plain strings, no glob syntax. A directory is hidden from the Data Files
// view if its name *contains* one of these terms, case-insensitively —
// "archive" hides archive/, old_archive/, and Archived_2024/ alike, at any
// depth. Checked against every directory segment of a file's path, never
// the file name itself, so "archive_run.xy" in a folder named "current" is
// not hidden. node_modules and .git are always hidden regardless of this
// setting. Applies immediately, no reload needed.
{
  "xyPlot.ignoreFolders": ["archive", "scratch", "_old"]
}
